#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0163 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
#note "dataset ADLBC structure=BDS. Columns STUDYID(Char), USUBJID(Char), PARAMCD(Char), BTOXGR(Char), ATOXGR(Char). ONE row: `CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | ALT | GRADE1 | GRADE2`. Both halves of the pair are declared, so the second conjunct `not var_exists('ATOXGR')` is FALSE and the rule is silent."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC structure=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col BTOXGR type=Char
col ATOXGR type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | ALT | GRADE1 | GRADE2
